Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Adaequare Settings OTP box: countdown timer and Resend
 OTP

Shows the time left on the OTP request (from its expires_at, measured
against the server clock), turns orange under 3 minutes and red under 1,
disables Verify when it runs out, and offers Resend OTP.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016uSTwic31grtwzMMK7rPAR
---
